/-!
# A212208

Triangle T(n,k), n>=1, 0<=k<=n^2, read by rows: row n gives the coefficients of the chromatic polynomial of the square diagonal grid graph DG_(n,n), highest powers first.

The 39 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A212208

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 0, 1, -6, 11, -6, 0, 1, -20, 174,
    -859, 2627, -5082, 6048, -4023, 1134, 0, 1, -42, 825,
    -10054, 85011, -528254, 2491825, -9084089, 25795983, -57031153, 97292827, -125639547, 118705077,
